            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phambi kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, endaweni ezakuyikhetha ukuba idunyiselwe kiyo, lizakudla okwetshumi kwamabele enu lokwewayini lenu lokwamagcobo enu, lamazibulo enkomo zenu lawezimvu zenu, ukuba lifunde ukuyesaba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu njalonjalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba indlela inde kakhulu kini, lahluleke ukuletha okwetshumi kwenu ngoba ikhatshana lani indawo iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ezakuyikhetha ukuba idunyiselwe kiyo, lapho elibusisile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lizakukhupha okwetshumi kwenu ngemali, liyiphathe, liye endaweni iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ezakuyikhetha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lithenge ngaleyomali lokho elikufisayo, izinkabi loba izimvu loba iwayini loba utshwala, loba kuyini inhliziyo yenu ekufisayo; lidle khona phambi kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, lithabe lina labendlu zenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UmLevi ophakathi kwemizi yenu lingamkhohlwa, ngoba engelasabelo lelifa kini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
