          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UmLevi, lokhu engelasabelo kini, kanye lowemzini, lentandane, lomfelwakazi abaphakathi kwemizi yenu bazakuza, badle, basuthe, ukuba iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ilibusise kuwo wonke umsebenzi wezandla zenu.",
          "type": "text",
